<title>USA: Fluor Corp issues $300 mln in 10-year notes.</title>
<headline>Fluor Corp issues $300 mln in 10-year notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Fluor Corp was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co. BORROWER FLUOR CORP AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 6.95 PCT   MATURITY 3/01/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.551  FIRST PAY DATE 9/01/97</p>
